WEBVTT

00:00:07.210 --> 00:00:13.800
<i>A new kind of disease has been 
spreading among young people.</i>

00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:17.280
<i>Following prolonged 
periods of Internet usage,</i>

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:23.420
<i>sufferers develop a pathological 
dependence on the Internet.</i>

00:00:23.820 --> 00:00:28.210
<i>Experts have named this 
disease "Internet Addiction."</i>

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:34.890
<i>In order to get these addicted 
youngsters back on the right track</i>

00:00:34.890 --> 00:00:39.130
<i>and reform them into independent, 
self-respecting adults,</i>

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:45.890
<i>the Elite Reeducation Academy, 
a civilian educational facility, was created.</i>

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:53.740
<i>It is a place to help young 
people to grow up right.</i>

00:02:27.540 --> 00:02:33.500
Episode 11
The Icy Wall of Despair

00:02:33.120 --> 00:02:38.010
Sis... is Papa really never coming home?

00:02:38.010 --> 00:02:41.030
Mama said he was just a little sick,

00:02:41.030 --> 00:02:44.000
and he would be back after a 
few days in the hospital...

00:02:47.780 --> 00:02:49.990
Don't worry, Shu-chan.

00:02:49.990 --> 00:02:52.040
I'm here with you.

00:02:52.040 --> 00:02:53.980
Mama's with us, too.

00:02:53.980 --> 00:02:55.940
Be a good boy, okay?

00:02:59.080 --> 00:03:00.490
Mom, I'm home.

00:03:00.800 --> 00:03:02.890
Did you go to pick up Shu-chan?

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:04.600
Mom?

00:03:04.600 --> 00:03:05.890
Are you asleep?

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:12.000
Mom!

00:03:12.240 --> 00:03:13.920
What happened?

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:15.230
In the apartment on the second floor...

00:03:15.230 --> 00:03:17.140
they say the husband died of illness,

00:03:17.140 --> 00:03:19.240
and the wife committed suicide with pills.

00:03:19.240 --> 00:03:21.030
They had two children, didn't they?

00:03:21.030 --> 00:03:22.270
They did!

00:03:22.270 --> 00:03:24.210
Who will look after them?

00:03:24.210 --> 00:03:26.020
Poor dears...

00:03:27.920 --> 00:03:29.210
Sis...

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:35.860
Sis, don't you worry.

00:03:35.860 --> 00:03:37.250
I'm here with you, right?

00:03:37.250 --> 00:03:40.240
I'm a boy, so I'll protect you, Sis.

00:03:40.240 --> 00:03:41.530
You'll be okay.

00:03:42.580 --> 00:03:43.860
Don't cry.

00:03:52.450 --> 00:03:53.940
Shu-chan...

00:03:54.710 --> 00:03:56.690
Shu-chan!

00:04:02.270 --> 00:04:04.510
Shiori, you've had a hard time, haven't you?

00:04:05.170 --> 00:04:07.890
You can live with me from now on.

00:04:10.290 --> 00:04:13.200
You both need a guardian.

00:04:13.520 --> 00:04:15.070
I'm your father's cousin, so we're relatives.

00:04:15.070 --> 00:04:18.300
It's only natural that 
I should look after you.

00:04:19.020 --> 00:04:23.490
Your parents would feel better 
knowing you were with me, too.

00:04:24.800 --> 00:04:27.490
We're going to be a family.

00:04:29.140 --> 00:04:31.000
Thank you, Uncle.

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:34.000
Examination Report

00:04:35.800 --> 00:04:37.500
I'm terribly sorry.

00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:39.640
The disease is hereditary.

00:04:39.640 --> 00:04:42.400
For your brother to show symptoms so early,

00:04:42.400 --> 00:04:43.730
it must be quite severe.

00:04:43.730 --> 00:04:46.150
You can cure my him, can't you?

00:04:46.150 --> 00:04:47.670
He'll get better, won't he?

00:04:47.670 --> 00:04:49.540
We won't know until we treat him.

00:04:49.540 --> 00:04:52.600
If there's a chance, we should try it.

00:04:53.010 --> 00:04:54.840
Don't worry about the cost.

00:04:54.840 --> 00:04:56.380
I'll cover it all.

00:04:56.380 --> 00:04:58.530
I'll save Shu-chan, I promise.

00:04:59.200 --> 00:05:00.520
Really?

00:05:01.640 --> 00:05:03.970
Thank you, Uncle.

00:05:04.400 --> 00:05:06.990
After all, we are family.

00:05:07.300 --> 00:05:11.000
Hey, Shiori. I'm so lonely.

00:05:11.510 --> 00:05:16.010
All the money I work so hard for 
gets spent on your brother's treatments...

00:05:16.770 --> 00:05:19.500
I just want a little appreciation...

00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:22.490
So that I can keep working 
hard to earn more money.

00:05:24.400 --> 00:05:25.600
Uncle...

00:05:26.700 --> 00:05:27.940
Please, stop...

00:05:27.940 --> 00:05:29.010
Did you tell me to stop?

00:05:29.570 --> 00:05:32.010
Don't you want me looking after Shu?

00:05:32.390 --> 00:05:36.020
I could be spending that money 
to enjoy myself in other ways.

00:05:36.310 --> 00:05:37.900
Is that what you want?

00:05:45.620 --> 00:05:48.990
I need to wash it all away.

00:05:50.090 --> 00:05:52.990
Wash it... clean...

00:05:54.010 --> 00:05:55.320
All of it...

00:05:58.990 --> 00:06:00.840
Shiori...

00:06:00.840 --> 00:06:03.570
I've worked very hard for Shu's sake.

00:06:03.570 --> 00:06:05.350
Won't you show me any gratitude?

00:06:05.830 --> 00:06:08.220
I paid those expensive medical bills...

00:06:08.630 --> 00:06:11.910
<i>Is he trying to say he paid 
for Shu-chan's treatment?</i>

00:06:11.910 --> 00:06:16.580
<i>Even though he stole all of 
our money when he took us in.</i>

00:06:16.580 --> 00:06:18.510
<i>The money for Shu-chan's treatment...</i>

00:06:18.510 --> 00:06:21.100
<i>the money you spend on entertainment...</i>

00:06:21.100 --> 00:06:23.520
<i>That's our parents' money!</i>

00:06:27.790 --> 00:06:31.500
Shiori, is this how you repay my generosity?

00:06:31.500 --> 00:06:32.990
You little brat...

00:06:33.410 --> 00:06:36.990
Who is it that's looked after 
you since your parents died?

00:06:37.340 --> 00:06:39.210
How dare you defy me...

00:06:39.490 --> 00:06:41.070
I know...

00:06:41.070 --> 00:06:44.000
I'll give you a real taste of loneliness.

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:46.000
I know just the place.

00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:49.510
You'll never see your brother again!

00:06:52.690 --> 00:06:54.720
What a sad fate!

00:06:55.520 --> 00:06:58.020
Oh, don't glare at me like that.

00:06:58.290 --> 00:07:00.200
I just want to help you.

00:07:01.110 --> 00:07:03.520
You want to hear your little 
brother's voice again, don't you?

00:07:03.810 --> 00:07:04.710
You...

00:07:04.710 --> 00:07:07.030
If you do everything I say,

00:07:07.200 --> 00:07:10.490
I can get you out of here in two days' time.

00:07:10.490 --> 00:07:11.740
What do you think?

00:07:36.290 --> 00:07:37.610
Hibiki-kun?

00:07:38.480 --> 00:07:41.890
Hibiki-kun, it's getting late. 
You're still out here?

00:07:41.890 --> 00:07:43.010
You'll catch cold...

00:07:45.070 --> 00:07:47.610
Hibiki-kun! What's wrong?

00:07:49.020 --> 00:07:52.990
Did you hear anything about Shin during 
the two weeks I was in the hole?

00:07:52.990 --> 00:07:55.990
Even the smallest thing... do you remember?

00:07:56.300 --> 00:07:58.140
No, I haven't heard anything.

00:07:58.140 --> 00:08:00.470
Why are you looking for Shin?

00:08:00.470 --> 00:08:03.000
Is he that important to you?

00:08:11.200 --> 00:08:12.610
That reminds me.

00:08:12.610 --> 00:08:14.880
Did you really escape?

00:08:15.900 --> 00:08:17.710
Yeah, I did...

00:08:18.110 --> 00:08:20.520
Are you gonna try to run away?

00:08:20.520 --> 00:08:22.250
Y-You'd better not try it...

00:08:22.250 --> 00:08:24.740
Even if you get out, 
they'll catch you right away.

00:08:24.740 --> 00:08:26.400
And then you'll really get it...

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:27.840
How did you escape?

00:08:27.840 --> 00:08:30.030
You didn't really dig a tunnel, did you?

00:08:30.630 --> 00:08:32.210
The truth is...

00:08:32.600 --> 00:08:34.980
I met a student with purple hair

00:08:35.300 --> 00:08:37.620
who gave me a map of the sewers

00:08:37.620 --> 00:08:40.170
and asked me, if I got out of here...

00:08:40.170 --> 00:08:41.610
Purple hair?

00:08:41.610 --> 00:08:42.640
That's Shin!

00:08:42.640 --> 00:08:44.240
No... Shin wasn't the student's name.

00:08:44.240 --> 00:08:45.920
But if I got out of here,

00:08:46.400 --> 00:08:49.010
I was supposed to post on the 
Internet about what happens here.

00:08:49.560 --> 00:08:52.300
But after I posted it, 
it was erased right away.

00:08:52.300 --> 00:08:54.500
My parents thought I wasn't cured yet,

00:08:54.500 --> 00:08:56.610
so they sent me back here.

00:08:58.710 --> 00:09:00.160
<i>Who could it be?</i>

00:09:02.710 --> 00:09:05.010
Class four, at ease!

00:09:05.010 --> 00:09:06.180
Attention!

00:09:06.520 --> 00:09:08.240
Turn right!

00:09:08.240 --> 00:09:10.320
Hey, look. It's class four.

00:09:10.320 --> 00:09:11.630
They're in total sync.

00:09:11.630 --> 00:09:12.800
It's pretty intimidating.

00:09:12.800 --> 00:09:14.410
Hey, Hibiki's giving them orders.

00:09:14.410 --> 00:09:16.790
I heard he beat Yoh yesterday.

00:09:16.790 --> 00:09:18.750
We'd better stay away from class four...

00:09:18.750 --> 00:09:20.100
Face forward!

00:09:20.100 --> 00:09:21.040
Attention!

00:09:21.040 --> 00:09:22.380
Listen closely, everyone!

00:09:22.380 --> 00:09:23.700
I want to use today's training

00:09:23.700 --> 00:09:25.940
to get Head Instructor 
Shian to acknowledge us.

00:09:25.940 --> 00:09:28.500
That's an important duty 
for new students like us.

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:30.000
If we get stronger,

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:32.360
other classes will stop mocking us,

00:09:32.360 --> 00:09:34.500
and we can get the head 
instructor on our side.

00:09:34.500 --> 00:09:36.440
We need to train 
with everything we've got

00:09:36.440 --> 00:09:38.010
so that we aren't left behind.

00:09:38.010 --> 00:09:39.170
Got that?

00:09:39.170 --> 00:09:40.500
Yes, leader!

00:09:41.010 --> 00:09:42.010
Right.

00:09:42.010 --> 00:09:43.200
At ease!

00:09:44.500 --> 00:09:46.740
<i>My only option is to win Shian over</i>

00:09:46.740 --> 00:09:49.020
<i>and collect more information that way.</i>

00:09:49.220 --> 00:09:52.790
<i>I'm positive Shin is still in the school.</i>

00:09:53.220 --> 00:09:54.370
The instructors are here!

00:09:54.370 --> 00:09:55.520
Hurry!

00:09:54.370 --> 00:09:55.520
Get back!

00:09:55.520 --> 00:09:56.910
We need to line up!

00:09:58.100 --> 00:09:59.310
<i>What the...</i>

00:10:01.270 --> 00:10:05.230
Looks like I get the pleasure 
of training this garbage.

00:10:11.090 --> 00:10:13.000
Allow me to introduce myself.

00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:14.870
My name is Hyo.

00:10:14.870 --> 00:10:16.500
Call me Big Bro Hyo.

00:10:16.500 --> 00:10:20.900
I suspended Shian for dereliction of duty.

00:10:20.900 --> 00:10:23.690
I'll be heading up his class for a while.

00:10:26.030 --> 00:10:29.020
<i>He suspended Shian? Who is this guy?</i>

00:10:29.020 --> 00:10:31.360
If the head instructor's been teaching you,

00:10:31.360 --> 00:10:33.300
you must be extremely excellent students.

00:10:33.300 --> 00:10:35.520
Don't disappoint me, all right?

00:10:35.600 --> 00:10:39.900
Your behavior will determine how soon 
the head instructor gets to return.

00:10:40.700 --> 00:10:43.060
<i>What the hell is going on?</i>

00:10:43.060 --> 00:10:46.600
<i>Shin is missing and Shian's suspended?</i>

00:10:46.600 --> 00:10:48.260
<i>Is this guy behind it all, somehow?</i>

00:10:48.260 --> 00:10:49.500
Well,

00:10:49.500 --> 00:10:54.000
I'd like to start with standing at attention, 
the head instructor's favorite lesson.

00:10:54.000 --> 00:10:55.360
Listen, everyone.

00:10:55.360 --> 00:10:58.500
If even one of you falls, you'll have 
to start from the beginning.

00:10:58.880 --> 00:11:02.000
You'll need to stand still for two hours 
without a single person breaking rank.

00:11:02.190 --> 00:11:03.520
Begin!

00:11:16.520 --> 00:11:18.530
<i>Who the hell is that guy?</i>

00:11:18.850 --> 00:11:20.980
<i>Shian's superior?</i>

00:11:20.980 --> 00:11:23.630
<i>What's his connection to Shin?</i>

00:11:24.310 --> 00:11:26.920
At this school, you will obey only

00:11:26.920 --> 00:11:30.490
the headmistress and myself.

00:11:29.170 --> 00:11:30.490
Listen to me.

00:11:30.490 --> 00:11:33.930
The new blood here has become my dog.

00:11:44.410 --> 00:11:45.520
Damn!

00:11:46.780 --> 00:11:49.070
One down already, eh?

00:11:49.070 --> 00:11:53.020
Did one of you fools really reach 
a tie with class six's leader?

00:11:53.500 --> 00:11:55.810
You'll all have to start over.

00:11:59.750 --> 00:12:01.120
Get up.

00:12:03.920 --> 00:12:06.460
What, you can't stay on your feet anymore?

00:12:06.870 --> 00:12:10.980
I can't give the signal 
to start until you stand.

00:12:11.490 --> 00:12:14.000
Everyone's waiting for you, you know...

00:12:16.300 --> 00:12:17.990
<i>Damn you...</i>

00:12:18.450 --> 00:12:21.600
<i>I'd finally united the class...</i>

00:12:22.980 --> 00:12:25.010
You gutless wonder.

00:12:27.170 --> 00:12:29.520
Big Bro Hyo, please stop.

00:12:29.790 --> 00:12:31.850
What happened yesterday 
was my responsibility,

00:12:31.850 --> 00:12:33.520
as was the fight with the girls' class.

00:12:33.520 --> 00:12:37.010
I'm also the one who reached a tie with 
Yoh-senpai in standing at attention.

00:12:37.010 --> 00:12:40.600
We're all new here, so we lack stamina.

00:12:40.600 --> 00:12:44.030
I will help you to direct them from now on.

00:12:44.030 --> 00:12:47.490
But for today, please limit 
your punishment to me alone.

00:12:54.200 --> 00:12:56.500
So you're the one, are you?

00:12:57.050 --> 00:12:59.500
Yes. I'm Hibiki.

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:02.500
If I've offended you, please punish me.

00:13:03.880 --> 00:13:06.460
Out of respect for your backbone,

00:13:06.460 --> 00:13:09.010
I'll give you one chance to reconsider.

00:13:11.020 --> 00:13:15.170
If you stand with everyone, 
you'll get out of this unscathed.

00:13:15.170 --> 00:13:17.760
But if you choose to stand out,

00:13:17.760 --> 00:13:19.790
don't blame me for what happens next.

00:13:20.340 --> 00:13:23.040
No matter what the punishment, I'll take it.

00:13:23.040 --> 00:13:25.030
Just spare the others, please.

00:13:26.490 --> 00:13:29.180
Okay, you can sit!

00:13:29.180 --> 00:13:31.990
Rest for ten minutes, 
then meet up with class six!

00:13:32.620 --> 00:13:35.010
Hibiki, come with me.

00:13:50.690 --> 00:13:54.010
It's been a while since you 
walked on nice carpet, has it?

00:13:54.500 --> 00:13:56.910
Big Bro, where are we going?

00:13:58.650 --> 00:14:00.060
Step inside.

00:14:02.700 --> 00:14:04.070
<i>What is this room?</i>

00:14:07.610 --> 00:14:09.570
Go on, sit down.

00:14:11.090 --> 00:14:12.840
No need to be nervous.

00:14:12.840 --> 00:14:14.490
Let's talk awhile.

00:14:14.490 --> 00:14:16.600
You'll get your punishment after that.

00:14:18.140 --> 00:14:19.580
I'm a student.

00:14:19.780 --> 00:14:22.090
What would you possibly 
want to talk to me about?

00:14:23.710 --> 00:14:25.590
A student, you say?

00:14:25.860 --> 00:14:29.770
But 99% of the people in here are students.

00:14:29.770 --> 00:14:31.560
Listen, Hibiki...

00:14:32.500 --> 00:14:37.560
You are the most important 
member of that 99%.

00:14:38.660 --> 00:14:40.290
What are you talking about?

00:14:41.340 --> 00:14:43.290
Oh, Hibiki.

00:14:43.560 --> 00:14:45.900
You know so little about yourself.

00:14:45.900 --> 00:14:49.600
Has your series of failures given 
you such an inferiority complex?

00:14:50.070 --> 00:14:53.830
I only just got here, 
but I've already heard your name.

00:14:53.830 --> 00:14:56.050
Instructors say you have promise,

00:14:56.050 --> 00:14:57.990
and students say you have guts.

00:14:57.990 --> 00:14:59.600
They respect you.

00:14:59.600 --> 00:15:02.600
You're the most famous 
person in the whole school.

00:15:02.600 --> 00:15:04.140
Not Shian or Ryo.

00:15:04.140 --> 00:15:05.580
Not Yoh, either, of course.

00:15:05.580 --> 00:15:07.580
You.

00:15:08.090 --> 00:15:09.950
Which means...

00:15:09.950 --> 00:15:13.560
the others see you as something special.

00:15:13.780 --> 00:15:16.430
You're their new leader.

00:15:17.490 --> 00:15:20.050
New leader?

00:15:20.400 --> 00:15:22.700
Student Council President Shiori.

00:15:22.700 --> 00:15:24.560
Discipline Officer Wudo.

00:15:24.800 --> 00:15:27.840
Vice Head Instructor Ryo's favorite, Yoh.

00:15:27.840 --> 00:15:30.070
They were all crushed by you.

00:15:30.250 --> 00:15:32.200
You want to rule the school, don't you?

00:15:32.660 --> 00:15:34.570
If you do what I say,

00:15:34.570 --> 00:15:37.780
manage the students with Instructor Ryo,

00:15:37.780 --> 00:15:40.160
and help us with our cell phone business,

00:15:40.160 --> 00:15:41.800
I'll help you out.

00:15:42.540 --> 00:15:45.900
You won't regret it, I promise.

00:15:48.760 --> 00:15:50.550
If you want to be my dog,

00:15:50.550 --> 00:15:52.670
you must meet the following conditions.

00:15:53.890 --> 00:15:57.990
You must climb your way 
to the top of the school.

00:15:58.790 --> 00:16:02.260
And I'll have you do something.

00:16:13.610 --> 00:16:14.690
I...

00:16:14.690 --> 00:16:16.320
Think it over.

00:16:16.320 --> 00:16:19.310
First, there's someone I want you to meet.

00:16:20.580 --> 00:16:22.210
Shu-chan...

00:16:23.780 --> 00:16:25.300
Shu-chan...

00:16:26.600 --> 00:16:28.080
Shu-chan...

00:16:29.700 --> 00:16:31.300
Shu-chan...

00:16:32.330 --> 00:16:33.870
Shiori.

00:17:02.470 --> 00:17:04.210
Shiori...

00:17:11.160 --> 00:17:12.590
Hibiki...

00:17:15.890 --> 00:17:17.310
Hibiki...

00:17:45.080 --> 00:17:49.100
She's the former student council president 
you've been fighting recently, isn't she?

00:17:49.110 --> 00:17:52.900
Did you have a nice reunion?

00:17:52.900 --> 00:17:55.100
When someone with power is on your side,

00:17:55.100 --> 00:17:57.910
no student will ever be able to defy you.

00:17:57.910 --> 00:17:59.710
If they do, well...

00:18:06.890 --> 00:18:08.760
Cry and beg me!

00:18:08.760 --> 00:18:09.560
Hey!

00:18:09.560 --> 00:18:11.560
You idiotic woman...

00:18:16.800 --> 00:18:19.020
I'm grateful to you, Big Bro.

00:18:19.020 --> 00:18:23.570
You've taught me what 
true authority and power are.

00:18:23.960 --> 00:18:26.180
This is what I've been looking for.

00:18:26.180 --> 00:18:28.430
I will swear my fealty to you.

00:18:28.430 --> 00:18:31.990
If there's anything I can do, 
I'll do it without question.

00:18:31.990 --> 00:18:33.580
Glad to hear it.

00:18:33.580 --> 00:18:36.010
I have high hopes for you.

00:18:36.400 --> 00:18:39.170
I lost a cell phone recently.

00:18:39.170 --> 00:18:43.550
If you can find it, I'll see to the rest.

00:18:43.810 --> 00:18:45.320
Leave it to me.

00:18:45.320 --> 00:18:47.500
I won't betray your expectations.

00:19:45.060 --> 00:19:47.490
Big Bro, Hibiki's here.

00:19:49.600 --> 00:19:51.080
Did you find it?

00:19:51.080 --> 00:19:52.780
That was fast.

00:19:52.780 --> 00:19:56.170
It was easy with everyone's help.

00:19:56.170 --> 00:19:57.760
It's charged, too.

00:19:57.760 --> 00:19:59.590
Go ahead and confirm it.

00:20:06.890 --> 00:20:08.330
Well done.

00:20:08.330 --> 00:20:09.860
Instructor Ryo.

00:20:09.860 --> 00:20:11.960
Finish things with Shiori.

00:20:11.960 --> 00:20:14.060
Wait, Big Bro...

00:20:14.350 --> 00:20:17.150
Would you please leave Shiori to me?

00:20:17.150 --> 00:20:18.800
We're not close,

00:20:18.800 --> 00:20:20.570
but we have known each other a long time.

00:20:21.110 --> 00:20:23.520
I've been thinking that tonight,

00:20:23.520 --> 00:20:26.200
I could fulfill a wish I've 
had since middle school.

00:21:14.100 --> 00:21:16.210
Shiori.

00:21:16.210 --> 00:21:18.090
Shiori...

00:21:18.090 --> 00:21:20.140
You're heavier than I expected.

00:21:20.770 --> 00:21:22.090
If I'd known this would happen,

00:21:22.090 --> 00:21:27.090
I would have called Hoku and 
Akane to help me carry you.

00:21:28.370 --> 00:21:33.500
Why did I never realize how heavy you were?

00:21:34.500 --> 00:21:38.040
I'm sorry, Shiori.

00:21:38.900 --> 00:21:40.700
This is all my fault.

00:21:42.060 --> 00:21:45.270
We'll be able to get out soon.

00:21:45.800 --> 00:21:47.710
Please, hang in there.

00:21:48.100 --> 00:21:50.600
We'll get out soon...

00:23:26.000 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

00:23:26.590 --> 00:23:28.120
Hibiki! Get out of here.

00:23:28.120 --> 00:23:30.230
Thank you, Head Instructor Shian.

00:23:30.230 --> 00:23:31.220
You must have other things to do.

00:23:31.220 --> 00:23:32.510
I'm truly grateful.

00:23:32.510 --> 00:23:33.800
Brother...

00:23:33.800 --> 00:23:36.710
my wonderful present is coming up.

00:23:35.080 --> 00:23:40.020
Final Episode
Evil or Live

00:23:36.710 --> 00:23:39.270
I hope you'll accept it.
